{
  "name": "[Portfolio] Website lead → CRM → Slack alert + auto-reply",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Website lead capture → AI research → CRM → instant alert\n**Client request:** *\"When someone fills out the contact form on my website, research who they are, add them to our CRM and notify the team on Slack.\"*\n\n1. Form submission comes in  2. Data is cleaned (name casing, lowercase email, phone digits)  3. Spam / junk is filtered out  4. **Business email?** → the company website is fetched (HTTP Request) and turned into text  5. **AI (Mistral)** writes a research brief: company, industry, size, what they want, fit score 1–5, next step  6. Lead is created **or updated** in the Google Sheets CRM (matched on email, no duplicates)  7. Sales gets a Slack alert with the brief (🔥 Hot if budget ≥ $5k)  8. Lead gets an instant thank-you email\n\n*Personal emails (Gmail, Outlook…) skip the website step. CRM = Google Sheet `Leads` tab — swap for HubSpot / Pipedrive / Airtable in one node. AI model = Mistral; swap for Claude / OpenAI in one node.*",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 2300
      },
      "id": "598d7b08-294f-4b35-a47f-8a1ce61b3cbf",
      "name": "Note: overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -80,
        -528
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 🔑 Connect before going live\n- **Mistral Cloud** (free API key) on *Mistral AI*\n- **Google Sheets** on *Save lead to CRM*\n- **Slack** on *Alert sales team*\n- **Gmail** on *Auto-reply to lead*",
        "height": 180,
        "width": 300,
        "color": 3
      },
